        <detaileddescription>
<para>custom constructor <simplesect kind="attention"><para>Use only this conctructor. <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_na_cl_sublimation_curve" kindref="compound">NaClSublimationCurve</ref> computes the vapor pressure of NaCl sublimation as a function of temperature. The latter is typically computed somewhere outside this class. By using const ref to that external variable as constructor argument, <ref refid="classcsmp_1_1_na_cl_sublimation_curve" kindref="compound">NaClSublimationCurve</ref> is able to decipher the current temperature value when being queried for the vapor pressure. Only this constructor is allowed to ensure that functionality, default constructor has been made private. </para>
</simplesect>
