    <briefdescription>
<para>Vapor pressure on the NaCl sublimation curve. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Thomas Driesner, ETH Zuerich, <ulink url="mailto:thomas.driesner@erdw.ethz.ch">thomas.driesner@erdw.ethz.ch</ulink></para>
